<resources>
    <string name="history_info_title">About history</string>
    <string name="history_info_body">Days adds up each calendar day while monitoring runs. Screen on and screen off count only time on battery; charged is the charge taken in. Days without monitoring stay empty.\n\nThe daily average covers the recorded days in the chosen range, without today until it is over. Deep sleep is how much of the time on battery the processor was fully asleep.\n\nA session runs from plugging in to unplugging, or the other way round. A gap in monitoring ends a session and starts a new one.</string>

